    "answer_text": "The distribution of population in the world is uneven due to various reasons: geographical factors (favourable topography, availability of mineral and fresh water resources, favourable climate and soil fertility), social and cultural factors (better housing, education, health facilities), and economic factors (more industries and employment opportunities).",
